  "modelTags": "PMDco,Materials,SemiFinishedProduct,TestPiece,BFO",
  "title": "Smart Data Models - PMD Core Ontology - Object",
  "description": "(Elucidation) An object is a material entity which manifests causal unity & is of a type instances of which are maximal relative to the sort of causal unity manifested (PMD Core Ontology 3.1.2 class 'object', http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000030. Entity type and attribute names are the PascalCase / camelCase forms of the English rdfs:labels; context.jsonld maps them to the PMDco, BFO, RO, IAO and OBI IRIs.)",
