      "description": "Property. Not a PMDco term (Smart Data Models addition) standing for rdf:type: the PMDco classes this entity is an instance of, given by their English rdfs:label, verbatim. Enum of the 27 non-deprecated classes of the 'object' branch (obo:BFO_0000030, the root and all subclasses in PMDco 3.1.2, including subclasses that PMDco only states through owl:intersectionOf), without the 'device' branch, which is the Device model. Several values are allowed (e.g. a material that is both 'steel' and 'structural material')."
    },
    "denotedBy": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "identifierClass": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "identifier",
              "symbol",
              "textual entity"
            ],
            "description": "Property. Not a PMDco term: the class of the information entity that denotes the entity (IAO identifier, symbol or textual entity), English rdfs:label."
          },
          "hasValue": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Property. Model:'https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000006'. PMDco 'has value': data property that relates an information content entity to a literal"
          },
          "label": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Property. Model:'http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label'. What kind of identifier it is, e.g. serial number, inventory number, specimen number."
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "identifierClass",
          "hasValue"
        ]
      },
      "description": "Property. Model:'http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000235'. PMDco 'denoted by': inverse of the relation 'denotes' Flattened from the PMDco 'device identifier' pattern: the entity is denoted by an identifier (or symbol, or textual entity) that has value a literal. Each item gives the identifier class, the literal and optionally a label."
