            "description": "Property. Not a PMDco term (Smart Data Models addition) standing for rdf:type of the characteristic: the rdfs:label (English, verbatim) of the PMDco/BFO class of the specifically dependent continuant (quality, property, disposition), one of the 415 non-deprecated classes under 'specifically dependent continuant' (obo:BFO_0000020)."
          },
          "hasSpecifiedNumericValue": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Property. Model:'http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001937'. PMDco 'has specified numeric value': A relation between a value specification and a number that quantifies it. The number of the scalar value specification."
          },
          "hasMeasurementUnitLabel": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "description": "Property. Model:'http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000039'. PMDco 'has measurement unit label'. The unit IRI. PMDco does not define units itself; its patterns use QUDT (http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/...) or UO units. QUDT unit IRIs are recommended, e.g. http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MegaPA."
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "characteristic",
          "hasSpecifiedNumericValue"
        ]
      },
      "description": "Property. Model:'http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000053'. PMDco 'has characteristic': Inverse of characteristic_of Flattened: in PMDco the bearer has a characteristic (an instance of a quality/property class), whose value is given by a scalar value specification (has value specification / specifies value of) with a number and a unit. Here each item gives the characteristic class, the number and the unit. Typical uses: extensive qualities of the object such as mass, length, thickness, width, cross section area or gauge length."
    },
    "hasRole": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "evaluant role",
          "investigation agent role",
          "manufacturer role",
          "material product role",
          "precursor role",
          "role",
          "sample role",
          "waste role"
        ]
      },
      "description": "Property. Model:'http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000087'. PMDco 'has role': a relation between an independent continuant (the bearer) and a role, in which the role specifically depends on the bearer for its existence The role classes borne (English rdfs:label), e.g. 'evaluant role' or 'sample role' for a test piece in an assay."
    },
    "hasPart": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string",
        "format": "uri"
      },
      "description": "Relationship. Model:'http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051'. PMDco 'has part': a core relation that holds between a whole and its part Points to Material entities (the portion of matter the object is made of, after the PMDco 'duality object material' pattern) or other Object entities."
    },
    "isSpecifiedInputOf": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string",
        "format": "uri"
      },
      "description": "Relationship. Model:'http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000295'. PMDco 'is specified input of': A relation between a completely executed planned process and a continuant participating in that process that is not created during the process. The presence of the continuant during the process is explicitly specified in the plan specification which the process realizes the concretization of. Points to ManufacturingProcess or Assay entities that take this object as specified input."
    },
    "isSpecifiedOutputOf": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string",
        "format": "uri"
      },
      "description": "Relationship. Model:'http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000312'. PMDco 'is specified output of': A relation between a completely executed planned process and a continuant participating in that process. The presence of the continuant at the end of the process is explicitly specified in the objective specification which the process realizes the concretization of. Points to ManufacturingProcess entities that produced this object."
    },
    "isManufacturedBy": {
      "type": "string",
      "format": "uri",
      "description": "Relationship. Model:'http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000304'. PMDco 'is_manufactured_by': c is_manufactured_by o means that there was a process p in which c was built in which a person, or set of people or machines did the work(bore the \"Manufacturer Role\", and those people/and or machines were members or of directed by the organization to do this. Points to the manufacturer (e.g. an Organization entity)."
    }
  },
